# Student Performance at Nights on Ocean Street

December 13th. Meet: 6:15pm Outside Solbar. Perform: 6:40 - 7:00pm To celebrate the end of a fantastic year with all of our amazing and dedicated students we will be  performing at the next upcoming Nights on Ocean Market in Maroochydore. Students will be playing what they have been learning including the rhythms Soli and Kassa. Be sure not to miss this event, we promise a dance floor on the streets of Maroochydore! [Nights on Ocean](https://www.facebook.com/nightsonocean?fref=ts "Nights on Ocean") [Rhythm Culture performance at Nights on Ocean](https://www.facebook.com/events/594122707302403/ "Rhythm Culture performance at Nights On Ocean")
